 "remarks": "Spacious 3-level Colonial in Stamford's Springdale neighborhood, near the Darien border! Offering 4 bedrooms, 2 full baths, 2,228 SF of living area, and approximately 3,864 SF of gross building area on a 0.19-acre lot. The main level features a welcoming foyer, generous living room with fireplace, formal dining room, eat-in kitchen, bedroom, and full bath. Three additional bedrooms and a full bath are on the second floor, while the third floor offers flexible office, exercise, or bonus space. Hardwood floors, gas heat, gas cooking, washer/dryer hookups in the basement, ample storage, a covered front porch, rear deck, private level backyard, large detached garage, and ample driveway parking. Conveniently located near Weed Memorial & Hollander Branch Library, Springdale School, restaurants, shops, and Springdale Train Station. Currently rented at $5,000/month on a month-to-month basis. Attractively priced with great potential for investors or future owner-occupants. Property offered AS-IS. Buyers to perform their own due diligence. Bring your best offer!",
